00:38:46.570 --> 00:38:56.090
Daniel Glinz (Glinz & Company GmbH): We can find out what can we influence, which variables do we need to influence, and how we can do that.

252
00:38:56.090 --> 00:39:08.140
Daniel Glinz (Glinz & Company GmbH): And one of these variables that is quite interesting is this delta here, and the delta is the discount factor of future payoffs from a collaboration.

