Daniel Glinz (Glinz & Company GmbH): is that we need to know a little bit something about the parties. And I guess there is information around, but that is going to be the big art, how to find the right signals for this kind of understanding. But first of all, we need to know a little bit more about the request, and also in the EU, and in Switzerland, you will have

