00:43:37.250 --> 00:43:54.000
Daniel Glinz (Glinz & Company GmbH): And in order to do that, we need to know about the request, we need also to know about the principal. Principal, in this case, is the person that the VTA is caring about, and maybe about his preferences, or her preferences, to be able to make this judgment.

